<title>BELGIUM: RESEARCH ALERT-CBR cut to sell-Generale.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CBR cut to sell-Generale.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale Bank said on Thursday it had downgraded shares in Belgian cement maker CBR to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; following a company meeting with analysts on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Management was unable to convince us of CBR's medium term outlook. Indeed, western Europe which contributes half of group sales is not expected to show any growth this year, and even a decrease seems likely,&quot; Generale Bank said in an investor note.</p>
<p>&quot;All in all, management confirmed its outlook of stable bottom line profits this year,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
